{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.46, "text": "We have systematically made it more expensive by letting people who bought a house and then"}, {"start": 6.46, "end": 10.62, "text": "pulled up the drawbridges around them not allowing more housing to be built."}, {"start": 10.94, "end": 18.76, "text": "We have a policy decision to let wealthy, typically older people protect their house"}, {"start": 18.76, "end": 23.8, "text": "value while younger people cannot afford a basic house."}, {"start": 24.72, "end": 28.0, "text": "And if you take a look at some young person and they're like, hey, I can barely afford"}, {"start": 28.0, "end": 31.98, "text": "my housing and I already live with a roommate, it's not fair to tell them, oh, you're not"}, {"start": 31.98, "end": 32.52, "text": "doing enough."}, {"start": 32.98, "end": 34.88, "text": "No, this is something that happened around you."}, {"start": 34.98, "end": 37.66, "text": "You were not even aware of it or a participant in it."}, {"start": 38.06, "end": 40.02, "text": "And you are the one bearing the brunt of it."}], "words": [{"w": "We", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0}, {"w": "have", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.32}, {"w": "systematically", "start": 0.32, "end": 1.26}, {"w": "made", "start": 1.26, "end": 1.8}, {"w": "it", "start": 1.8, "end": 1.96}, {"w": "more", "start": 1.96, "end": 2.28}, {"w": "expensive", "start": 2.28, "end": 3.02}, {"w": "by", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.58}, {"w": "letting", "start": 3.58, "end": 3.84}, {"w": "people", "start": 3.84, "end": 4.28}, {"w": "who", "start": 4.28, "end": 5.2}, {"w": "bought", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.48}, {"w": "a", "start": 5.48, "end": 5.62}, {"w": "house", "start": 5.62, "end": 5.9}, {"w": "and", "start": 5.9, "end": 6.32}, {"w": "then", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.46}, {"w": "pulled", "start": 6.46, "end": 6.86}, {"w": "up", "start": 6.86, "end": 7.0}, {"w": "the", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.16}, {"w": "drawbridges", "start": 7.16, "end": 7.76}, {"w": "around", "start": 7.76, "end":